  "title": "Trigger Control",
  "summary": "控制 M 态断点触发器及陷阱前使能状态。",
  "summaryEn": "Control M-mode breakpoint triggers and saved enable state.",
  "privilege": "M",
  "access": "RW",
  "xlens": [
    32,
    64
  ],
  "condition": "Sdtrig；由 tselect 选择触发器，可选实现受规范限制",
  "notes": "Debug 1.0；DM/DMI、JTAG 及调试器虚拟寄存器不属于 hart CSR。 触发器在 Debug Mode 中不触发；DMODE=1 时只有 Debug Mode 可修改配置。功能是否实现需通过规范探测。",
  "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/riscv/riscv-debug-spec/blob/5695c0aaa7a3c228e14702e1268eb5a5e50e3cb8/xml/hwbp_registers.xml#L207-L237",
